content.text:
verdict: clean
scenario_results:
  - {scenario: 1, result: pass, notes: "name, description, tools, maxTurns are lines 1-4 of frontmatter, before type/id/owner; instantiation needs nothing outside the file; no actor-kind commitment anywhere in the prose"}
  - {scenario: 2, result: pass, notes: "no sentence states when the seat acts or names a preceding/following step; description and accountabilities are who/what only"}
  - {scenario: 3, result: pass, notes: "exactly one labeled claim, decision-phrased: 'what the shop takes an expression to be asking for is decided by this seat alone'"}
  - {scenario: 4, result: pass, notes: "6 bullets, in range; each names a checkable output or judgment (recorded framing, recorded convergence, cold-read-verified material, Document History entries, glossary flow, traceable provenance) — no character traits"}
  - {scenario: 5, result: pass, notes: "no read-only or restriction claim in prose to enforce; write duties matched by Edit/Write; drift-prone working seat carries maxTurns: 100; nothing enforceable left unenforced"}
stumbles: ["cold-read verified per the presenting process — the process is alluded to, not named or linked; a cold reader cannot resolve which process", "the presentation discipline the stakeholder-facing processes name — same unresolvable allusion", "convergence recorded on the conversation's anchor — 'anchor' is undefined in the file and not obviously a glossary term"]
top_changes: ["Name or link the presenting process instead of 'the presenting process'", "Define or link 'the conversation's anchor' so the convergence accountability is checkable by a cold reviewer", "Link 'the glossary' in the terms accountability to its authoritative home"]
